    ('nutmegandclove', 'Singaporean Identities', 2023, 3, 'Twelve drinks celebrating well-known Singaporean chefs, entertainers and personalities.', ARRAY['F** Your Banana', 'Organic Fusion', 'For The Love of Kueh', 'Fried Rice Paradigm']::text[], 'https://web.archive.org/web/20230320212721/https://www.nutmegclove.com/_files/ugd/39dbee_2576e70281174303988ffac79916e16a.pdf'),
